WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
01 · Start your heist
Open The heist and choose Start a demo heist. No wallet is needed in this preview.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
02 · Make your case
Write a story, a clever trade, or a kind reason to share. You have 500 characters per prompt.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
03 · Send your first prompt
Press Enter or select the orange arrow. Shift + Enter adds a new line.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
04 · Read Caspy’s reply
Wait for the response to finish. Each completed turn uses one of your three prompts.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
04 · Read and try again
The candy counter now shows two chances. Read Caspy’s reply and build on your story.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
04 · Use your next chance
Keep the conversation in Caspy’s world. You can make a trade, tell a story, or try a little humor.

7
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
04 · Give it one last try
After your third completed prompt, the demo reveals the ending selected in Preview outcome.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
05 · See your result
When the conversation finishes, select See your result. The demo uses your preview ending.

9
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
05 · Your Trick or Treat
The result screen shows your keepsake and prompts used. Choose Claim your Treat or Claim your Trick.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
06 · Preview your claim
Select Simulate claim to explore the keepsake flow. The demo never opens a real transaction.

11
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
07 · Your demo keepsake
Your simulated claim is complete. Return to The heist to try again. No transaction or NFT was created.

